raction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerAffiliationAxis_us-gaap_InvestmentAffiliatedIssuerControlledMember_9qs_K-oAPUSyDULWTefpTg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValue" scale="3" id="Tc_BFoCnaQBr0682tSHbJfy5g_32_23">107,530</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><div style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:6.0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;min-height:1.19em;position:relative;width:100%;"><div style="background-color:#000000;height:1pt;position:relative;top:0.6em;width:25.0%;border:none;margin:0 auto 0 0;"></div></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:0pt;">*</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:0pt;">For more information, see &#8220;Management of the STRS JV.&#8221;</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(1)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Refer to the consolidated schedule of investments for the principal amount, industry classification and other security detail of each portfolio company.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(2)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Gross additions may include increases in the cost basis of investments resulting from new portfolio investments, PIK, an exchange of existing investments for new investments and the transfers of an existing portfolio company into this category from a different category.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(3)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Gross reductions may include decreases in the cost basis of investments resulting from principal collections related to investment repayments or sales, an exchange of existing investments for new investments and the transfers of an existing portfolio company from this category to a different category.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt;"></div></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In January 2024, as part of a restructuring agreement between the Company and Arcstor Midco, LLC (d/b/a Arcserve (USA), the Company&#8217;s first lien secured term loan and priority first lien delayed draw loan investments in Arcstor Midco, LLC (d/b/a Arcserve (USA), converted into a new&#160;first lien secured delayed draw loan and&#160;unsecured notes in Arcserve Cayman Opco LP (d/b/a Arcserve (USA), LLC) and common equity of Arcserve Cayman GP LLC (d/b/a Arcserve (USA), LLC) and Arcserve Cayman Topco LP (d/b/a Arcserve (USA), LLC).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">In September 2024, as part of a restructuring and partial foreclosure agreement between the Company and Honors Holdings, LLC (d/b/a Orange Theory), the Company&#8217;s first lien secured term loan, first lien delayed draw loan and revolver investments in Honors Holdings, LLC, which had a historical cost basis of&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_HonorsHoldingsLLCMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredTermLoanDelayedDrawLoanRevolverLoanMember_NF7AaKTpD029Proq5qTn1A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_ANKEoL2b7UmHjbXm5XVLRQ">17,816</ix:nonFraction>, were converted into a new first lien secured term loan of Camarillo Fitness Holdings, LLC (f/k/a Honors Holdings, LLC) and common equity interests in H.I.G. Camarillo, L.P. (f/k/a Honors Holdings, LLC). As of the </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">149</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:93.09%;border:0;margin:30pt 3.45% 30pt 3.45%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:3.45%;padding-right:3.45%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:5.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">WHITEHORSE FINANCE,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Notes To Consolidated Financial Statements</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">December&#160;31, 2025</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Group_-_0T0Jo_c0CIJ2vDb16yow_cont6" continuedAt="Group_-_0T0Jo_c0CIJ2vDb16yow_cont7"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">restructuring date, these investments had an adjusted cost basis of&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_CamarilloFitnessHoldingsLlcAndHigCamarilloLpMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredTermLoanAndCommonEquityInterestsMember_PVPGedYb-U-SwTvIZZwUAw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_h6zmqMuORUamo6NYAQZK6w">10,234</ix:nonFraction>. The remaining portion of the Honors Holdings, LLC first lien secured investments, with a cost basis of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_HonorsHoldingsLLCMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredInvestmentsMember_845IH_tIf0qj8tRKpy5rwQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_O2pydAIR7Euu2szvRAAKfA">7,582</ix:nonFraction>, was recognized as a net realized loss in the consolidated statements of operations.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">In June 2025, as part of a restructuring agreement between the Company and Telestream Holdings Corporation, the Company&#8217;s first lien secured term loan and revolver investments to Telestream Holdings Corporation, which had a cost basis of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_TelestreamHoldingsCorporationMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredTermLoanAndRevolverLoansMember_rKUJUdLoQkKtXhPdoS3NLg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_UJXMjhujL0OSgc3o3Dpt3A">18,547</ix:nonFraction>, were converted into a new first lien secured term loan in Telestream 2 LLC (d/b/a Telestream Holdings Corporation) and common equity of Telestream Topco 2 LLC (d/b/a Telestream Holdings Corporation).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">In September 2025, as part of a restructuring agreement between the Company and MSI Information Services, Inc., the Company&#8217;s first lien secured term loan and revolver investments to MSI Information Services, Inc., </span>which had a cost basis of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_MsiInformationServicesIncMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredTermLoanAndRevolverLoansMember_1AQ14CTEsU6cUu_g81E9OQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_MBzhBa3wNU6Lvp-taRUYJg">9,602</ix:nonFraction> were converted into a new first lien secured term loan and revolver investments of Media Source, LLC (d/b/a Media Source Inc.) and<span style="background:#ffffff;"> into common equity in TVG I-E-MSI Acquisition, LLC (d/b/a Media Source, Inc). </span>The remaining portion of the <span style="background:#ffffff;">MSI Information Services, Inc. </span>first lien secured investments, with a cost basis of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_MsiInformationServicesIncMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredInvestmentsMember_XjTbkJzmuUWYi1N0WrK7AA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_Smzd--NQFkOdDwGItiw5uA">2,111</ix:nonFraction>, was recognized as a net realized loss in the consolidated statements of operations.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">In October 2025, as part of a restructuring agreement between the Company and Alvaria Holdco (Cayman) (d/b/a Aspect Software, Inc.), a portion of the Company&#8217;s first lien secured term loan investments to Alvaria Holdco (Cayman) (d/b/a Aspect Software, Inc.),&#160;which had a cost basis of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_AlvariaHoldcoMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredTermLoanMember_moBF6x2iMUybfzDbltZi7w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_lwHTtEHOk0CLWnJ30imrRw">1,682</ix:nonFraction>&#160;were converted into common equity in Atlas Parent, LLC (d/b/a&#160;Alvaria, Inc.).&#160;The remaining portion of the&#160;Alvaria Holdco (Cayman) (d/b/a Aspect Software, Inc.)&#160;first lien secured investments, with a cost basis of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentIssuerNameAxis_whfcl_AlvariaHoldcoMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_whfcl_FirstLienSecuredInvestmentsMember_BY210OSIe0yT_4KGUQ4uig" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_2KpXsvkKCE-Pee5hTQZSeg">11,182</ix:nonFraction>, was recognized as a net realized loss in the consolidated statements of operations.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">WHF STRS Ohio Senior Loan Fund LLC</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 14, 2019, the Company entered into an LLC operating agreement with STRS Ohio to co-manage a newly formed joint venture investment company, STRS JV, a Delaware LLC. STRS Ohio and the Company committed to provide up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_1_14_2019_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_Prm9vNefnUC0OyAb3bsoXg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CombinedCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_Zt45u5TN1k2WlHDw8RoU2w">125,000</ix:nonFraction> of subordinated notes and equity to STRS JV, with STRS Ohio providing up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_1_14_2019_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_CCHonRLjP0aBgVS08b4Cjg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_DnoOzp258kaN00eOxYa0PQ">50,000</ix:nonFraction> and the Company providing up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_1_14_2019_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_Prm9vNefnUC0OyAb3bsoXg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_9TMm_jVWFkOb2xN8aDNh0g">75,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. In July 2019, STRS JV formally launched operations. STRS JV invests primarily in lower middle market, senior secured debt facilities, to performing lower middle market companies across a broad range of industries that typically carry a floating interest index rate such as SOFR and have a term of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_RxVzAVAMaEenxiFRXxuLrQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three</span></span> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2019_To_7_31_2019_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrOvernightIndexSwapRateMember_bzLDzgMu006Ty2ordBE00w" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_vxiNyxk0Y0muhgZ0DzCrwg">six years</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In February 2022, the Company increased its capital commitment to the STRS JV in the amount of an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_MW1tQa6GzEu2XPcXoTn_bA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:IncreaseDecreaseCompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_yOu_MA17LEyeC7Fgda-eYw">25,000</ix:nonFraction>, which brought the Company&#8217;s total capital commitment to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_MW1tQa6GzEu2XPcXoTn_bA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_kXcYy6AaTUaY6s-KbMa3lw">100,000</ix:nonFraction>, comprised of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_8spjJPgSEUKK8Yq8eFUkdQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_w6w7O0QTWUyU4s0vsXz8OQ">80,000</ix:nonFraction> of subordinated notes and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_Q0LTCXl6Sk-pkN11SfrrcQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_Yu_HEhn_QU24HV4nEBiouQ">20,000</ix:nonFraction> of LLC equity interests.&#160;In connection with this increase in the Company&#8217;s capital commitment, the Company and STRS Ohio&#8217;s amended economic ownership in the STRS JV was approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_MW1tQa6GzEu2XPcXoTn_bA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_6jj5ydSjv0iSnEvL657ijQ">66.67</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_oKb-_ug4mUWtbQlFQzfSDg" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_lA10dsHvyEWZoPMavNyjlw">33.33</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In February 2023, the Company increased its commitment to the STRS JV in the amount of an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_tJYLO6F6N0mPCNKmEzR9-w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:IncreaseDecreaseCompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_r0BoKEokhE24PPf_5jMJTA">15,000</ix:nonFraction>, which brought the Company&#8217;s total capital commitment to the STRS JV to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_tJYLO6F6N0mPCNKmEzR9-w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_nkaeP2L5CEmjJCLW2RBMAQ">115,000</ix:nonFraction>, comprised of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_rBZ_uiC700yGPHyyXKs--w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_HWo7hJN2xUm3tRDcvn9yWw">92,000</ix:nonFraction> of subordinated notes and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_QzThtA-BgUiqRqI0z2SnvQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_AKzozEbNO0G0lNaI1sbBKQ">23,000</ix:nonFraction> of LLC equity interests, and STRS Ohio increased its capital commitment to the STRS JV in the amount of an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_7CfgmghPk0KsKyDqiQGQnQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:IncreaseDecreaseCompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_EplMi25tQ0y5I9NR2i3KGg">10,000</ix:nonFraction>, which brought its total capital commitment to the STRS JV to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_7CfgmghPk0KsKyDqiQGQnQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_hdEhBmeBi0qnRhlIzAMxig">60,000</ix:nonFraction>, comprised of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_F--0_SPb3Eag2kmaGovCwQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_Up-pCpkRSEe6XXspxFr0OA">48,000</ix:nonFraction> of subordinated notes and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_cdLJVdYujke9mr6lfHmKHA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CompanyCommitmentToFundJointVenture" scale="3" id="Narr_dJe8v1E0H0yCrwmAk6npJg">12,000</ix:nonFraction> of LLC equity interests. In connection with these increases in capital commitments, the Company&#8217;s and STRS Ohio&#8217;s amended economic ownership in the STRS JV was approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_tJYLO6F6N0mPCNKmEzR9-w" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Q3DUzHyM70ia09ZZBbLWiw">65.71</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemOhioMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_7CfgmghPk0KsKyDqiQGQnQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_slYm6rh3q0STzRbp-bgYLg">34.29</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">As of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31,&#160;2024, STRS JV had total assets of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_4dPAXn2pNEuEF_XiQ5Pi1w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_NXaFpWjIvUidT0w6vMBmVg">335,887</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_vnue8EhIl062kb3HuaN9rg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_2SKTzj7M6E-WbVViHUqhfg">309,077</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. STRS JV&#8217;s portfolio consisted of debt investments in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_company_8-mj_LpOSE6oD4Nu8dZpGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_4dPAXn2pNEuEF_XiQ5Pi1w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:InvestmentCompanyPortfolioCompanies" scale="0" id="Narr_RFWqlUnMYkaxsTrdfbuDyA">43</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_company_8-mj_LpOSE6oD4Nu8dZpGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_vnue8EhIl062kb3HuaN9rg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:InvestmentCompanyPortfolioCompanies" scale="0" id="Narr_00j1hGPrekWdnIw4oqKMeA">38</ix:nonFraction> portfolio companies as of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31,&#160;2024. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31,&#160;2024, the largest investment by aggregate principal amount (including any unfunded commitments) in a single portfolio company in STRS JV&#8217;s portfolio was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_4dPAXn2pNEuEF_XiQ5Pi1w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueSingleLargestInvestment" scale="3" id="Narr_P0jC9U7iKki1klACrZSjEw">19,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_vnue8EhIl062kb3HuaN9rg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueSingleLargestInvestment" scale="3" id="Narr_GFvRjjRON0OKy2p0U0XHBw">19,594</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. The five largest investments in portfolio </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">150</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:93.09%;border:0;margin:30pt 3.45% 30pt 3.45%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:3.45%;padding-right:3.45%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:5.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">WHITEHORSE FINANCE,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Notes To Consolidated Financial Statements</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">December&#160;31, 2025</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Group_-_0T0Jo_c0CIJ2vDb16yow_cont7" continuedAt="Group_-_0T0Jo_c0CIJ2vDb16yow_cont8"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">companies by fair value in STRS JV totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_4dPAXn2pNEuEF_XiQ5Pi1w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueFiveLargestInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_Gf7M3MZlk0e6OkyFXLrxuw">75,398</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_vnue8EhIl062kb3HuaN9rg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueFiveLargestInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_IK35DydoPk27A9C2Ni8sYw">79,058</ix:nonFraction> as of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31,&#160;2024, respectively. STRS JV invests in portfolio companies in the same industries in which the Company may directly invest.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company provides capital to STRS JV in the form of LLC equity interests and through interest-bearing subordinated notes. As of both December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December 31, 2024, the Company and STRS Ohio owned <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_4dPAXn2pNEuEF_XiQ5Pi1w" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ye4yJPfaD0WGKS70D1nerQ">65.71</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_vnue8EhIl062kb3HuaN9rg" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_SABNCSwwrUScfYdijDRpZg">34.29</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively, of the LLC equity interests of STRS JV. The Company&#8217;s investment in STRS JV consisted of equity contributions of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_KuA7E5DELUamV3oBpcmMTA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_uRGzXBPQfUyh5swMN9MtpQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_-bffDQrHo02iB5wpo4iyJg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_49FwqIMpnku2A2EyaZbeQQ">21,104</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> and advances of the subordinated notes of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_QhcABhUtHESbEhjIt9bTeQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_AieWSR-WNkCvrO4PWmiCfA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_htX31Xr3mEG3FKLncG4VEA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedAtCost" scale="3" id="Narr_E9L-SRS3jEChbgaM3wGjjQ">84,416</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> as of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31, 2024. As of both December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December 31, 2024, the Company had commitments to fund equity interests and subordinated notes in STRS JV of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_FphCHqSDhU2ejnZXguAshw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CommitmentsToFundEquityInterests" scale="3" id="Narr_TLi0HFjhgUWkKYbeKS5Yvw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_i5mpdDUop02gatsdWtvgug" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CommitmentsToFundEquityInterests" scale="3" id="Narr_W0utbfSXLkCFYSOxgRhZIA">23,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_3BkP3yS6dk6zTAKQ_b1rOg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CommitmentsToSubordinatedNotes" scale="3" id="Narr_DJCdtHKWmEaV8pjbi6ZAtQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_aTjjy-JU90iCYQ9RTf7vRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:CommitmentsToSubordinatedNotes" scale="3" id="Narr_R_hY90-MxEylL8wSS9Na_A">92,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>, respectively, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_FphCHqSDhU2ejnZXguAshw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:UnfundedCommitmentEquityInterests" scale="3" id="Narr_k40MIvcq7k6OTrnGbq99Cw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_EquitySecuritiesMember_i5mpdDUop02gatsdWtvgug" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:UnfundedCommitmentEquityInterests" scale="3" id="Narr_JCZh6k0Z6U2yUoRvK3cd2Q">1,896</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_3BkP3yS6dk6zTAKQ_b1rOg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:UnfundedCommitmentSubordinateNotes" scale="3" id="Narr__DR197HGR0u0WCOxUYEqmg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_InvestmentTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_aTjjy-JU90iCYQ9RTf7vRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:UnfundedCommitmentSubordinateNotes" scale="3" id="Narr_cV4Lhh3sSUeFCUC0ksmJbA">7,584</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> were unfunded.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company and STRS Ohio each appoint two members to STRS JV&#8217;s four-person board of managers. All material decisions with respect to STRS JV, including those involving its investment portfolio, require unanimous approval of a quorum of the board of managers. Quorum is defined as (i) the presence of two members of the board of managers; provided that at least one individual is present that was elected, designated or appointed by each member; (ii) the presence of three members of the board of managers; provided that the individual that was elected, designated or appointed by the member with only one individual present shall be entitled to cast two votes on each matter; or (iii) the presence of four members of the board of managers; provided that two individuals are present that were elected, designated or appointed by each member.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 19, 2019, STRS JV entered into a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_7_19_2019_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_6yGB_SvfHEG9G7YABT7maA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_7pHMO38MEEiiIiS2It6u_Q">125,000</ix:nonFraction> credit and security agreement (the &#8220;STRS JV Credit Facility&#8221;) with JPMorgan Chase Bank, National Association (&#8220;JPMorgan&#8221;). On January 27, 2021, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were amended to, among other things, increase the size of the STRS JV Credit Facility from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_7_19_2019_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_6yGB_SvfHEG9G7YABT7maA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_baerFEd5ckWDYmlJfbSkAw">125,000</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_1_27_2021_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_Ovfg9oneH0SBt5ju4hjDYQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_Sz7p-vJWzUaW8vsbS1HtMg">175,000</ix:nonFraction>. On April 28, 2021, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were amended and restated to, among other things, enable borrowings in British pounds or euros. On July 15, 2021, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were amended to, among other things, allow STRS JV to reduce the applicable margins for interest rates to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_7_15_2021_To_7_15_2021_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_3qIkkS1GQUi13PfeyyrTFQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_edaywGnSw0Giza_4-s0ZMw">2.35</ix:nonFraction>%, extend the non-call period from January 19, 2022 to January 19, 2023, extend the end of the reinvestment period from July 19, 2022 to July 19, 2023 and extend the scheduled termination date from July 19, 2024 to July 19, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 11, 2022, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were further amended to, among other things, (i) permanently increase STRS Credit&#8217;s availability under the Credit Facility from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_1_27_2021_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_Ovfg9oneH0SBt5ju4hjDYQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_Jwyffj3gy02P3JD-Nq02zQ">175,000</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_3_11_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_P1KoRskf-Eq1KijWrnWtRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr__yEp8D6HUE-lDgjTF33ihg">225,000</ix:nonFraction>, (ii) increase the minimum funding amount from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_3_10_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_m_oXhAkZJUS4BLv3XeQCvA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_qL7YsB5rUEy6Kfj63VQQUg">131,250</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_3_11_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_P1KoRskf-Eq1KijWrnWtRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_NeV21hfDnk6flXp153MgWA">168,750</ix:nonFraction>, and (iii) apply an annual interest rate equal to the applicable SOFR plus <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_3_11_2022_To_3_11_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrOvernightIndexSwapRateMember_o4Wl4I0XXE-uL1sL32zxaQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_sNnwtdMGrkqA9Iw7y1K5gg">2.50</ix:nonFraction>% to borrowings greater than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_3_11_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_P1KoRskf-Eq1KijWrnWtRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:LineOfCreditFacilityInterestRateThresholdAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_8a0kJVqAc0ieABRQzhhWhA">175,000</ix:nonFraction> in the Credit Facility.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 13, 2023, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were further amended to, among other things, (i) permanently increase STRS Credit&#8217;s availability under the STRS JV Credit Facility from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_3_11_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_P1KoRskf-Eq1KijWrnWtRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_X2Egd0NUCEGmOgLZAGk-fQ">225,000</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_1_13_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_PfZNy5QIyE-T58mZn3yxJg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_caYr-FygnkqYzVmQjAi-BQ">262,500</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_13_2023_To_1_13_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_8G1ssh8R60O3C91Z6J1-AA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityIncreaseDecreaseForPeriodNet" scale="6" id="Narr_5EvBbsE7jEiLJiaykaTusA">37.5</ix:nonFraction> Million Increase&#8221;) and (ii) apply an annual interest rate equal to applicable SOFR, plus <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_1_13_2023_To_1_13_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_whfcl_BorrowingsUnder375MillionMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrOvernightIndexSwapRateMember_wGz4RW3XykqvHGOSojVyMw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_ByYA__oEvk6PFQHiURLhqg">3.00</ix:nonFraction>% to any borrowings under the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_1_13_2023_To_1_13_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_8G1ssh8R60O3C91Z6J1-AA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityIncreaseDecreaseForPeriodNet" scale="6" id="Narr_cIu50ny1wk6JURjFGzfs2A">37.5</ix:nonFraction> Million Increase in the STRS JV Credit Facility.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 18, 2023, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were further amended to, among other things, (i) effective June 6, 2023 apply an annual interest rate equal to applicable SOFR plus <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_5_18_2023_To_5_18_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrOvernightIndexSwapRateMember_H_GNdhPHYUiPFkMtWgSL-Q" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_NSOsFuRLaUaY1nNxyZIXAA">2.72</ix:nonFraction>% to any USD borrowings, (ii) extend the scheduled termination date from July 19, 2025 to July 19, 2026, (iii) extend the non-call period from January 19, 2023 to January 19, 2024 and (iv) extend the end of the reinvestment period from July 19, 2023 to July 19, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">On May 8, 2024, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were further amended to (i) effective May 8, 2024 apply an annual interest rate equal to applicable&#160;<span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">base rate </span>plus <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_8_5_2024_To_8_5_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityEurGbpAndUsdDenominatedBorrowingsMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_5qCzLY_29UmeSp9Ljbyo7w" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_ptQBO8V-IE2-qtKCyu8QHg">2.50</ix:nonFraction>% to any EUR, GBP and USD denominated borrowings and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_8_5_2024_To_8_5_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityCadDenominatedBorrowingsMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_zjmeU65W6UqZsoZeEkfnlg" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_h7PMiuBj9E20DnvpSfCrsw">2.82</ix:nonFraction>% to any CAD denominated borrowings (ii) extend the scheduled termination date from July 19, 2026 to January 19, 2028 (iii) extend the non-call period from January&#160;19, 2024 to May 8, 2025 and (iv) extend the end of the reinvestment period from July&#160;19, 2024 to January 19, 2026.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">151</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:93.09%;border:0;margin:30pt 3.45% 30pt 3.45%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:3.45%;padding-right:3.45%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:5.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">WHITEHORSE FINANCE,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Notes To Consolidated Financial Statements</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">December&#160;31, 2025</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Group_-_0T0Jo_c0CIJ2vDb16yow_cont8"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On November 26, 2024, the terms of the STRS JV Credit Facility were further amended to, among other things, (i) reduce the spread from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_11_26_2024_To_11_26_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_isLaBwzqDkOi4jh3nkQzMw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_sy2X3fKMrk2YscHVbO6aUw">2.50</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_11_26_2024_To_11_26_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_tCEp0X_PXEK52Vj7HrONKQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_B2CrajYbLUipaqgrU3Kjug">2.25</ix:nonFraction>%, (ii) extend the non-call period from May 8, 2025, to November 26, 2026, (iii) extend the reinvestment period from January 19, 2026, to November 26, 2027, and (iv) extend the termination date from January 19, 2028, to November 26, 2029.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">As of December&#160;31,&#160;2025, the STRS JV Credit Facility had $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureInvestmentCompanyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_StateTeachersRetirementSystemJointVentureCreditFacilityMember_mKv11eZepUKYIkxekSzSTQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="3" id="Narr_1OFeebJ7p0Gi-ZJxmBdnrQ">262,500</ix:nonFraction> of commitments subject to leverage and borrowing base restrictions with an interest rate based on a risk-free index rate such as SOFR plus a spread of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_