i6-JrNA">2.1</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, respectively, as of December 31,&#160;2025.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(3)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The interest rate is the &#8220;all-in-rate&#8221; including the current index and spread, the fixed rate, and the PIK interest rate, as the case may be.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(4)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Except as otherwise noted, all of the STRS JV&#8217;s portfolio company investments, which as of the date of the portfolio represented </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_8JkZJmbCS0KmD2wvl0Fxsg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedPercentOfNetAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_yhHaqMq75U-fsCHgkJ0uuw">984.3</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> of STRS JV&#8217;s members&#8217; equity or </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_8XoNYfq_N0mb6yk3N7-fvQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:PortfolioCompanyInvestmentsAsPercentageOfTotalAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_g3NOz0raaUumJeVTtP6jZg">96.3</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> of STRS JV&#8217;s total assets, are subject to legal restrictions on sales.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(5)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The fair value of each investment was determined using significant unobservable inputs.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(6)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment or a portion of the investment does not provide collateral for the STRS JV Credit Facility.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(7)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The rate shown is the annualized seven-day yie</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">ld as of December 31,&#160;2025.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(8)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in GBP and the issuer is domiciled in the United Kingdom.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(9)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in Euros.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(10)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;"> Principal amount is denominated in CAD.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(11)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Investment is structured as a unitranche loan in which the STRS JV may receive additional interest on its &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche of the portfolio company&#8217;s senior term debt, which was previously syndicated into &#8220;first out&#8221; and &#8220;last out&#8221; tranches, whereby the &#8220;first out&#8221; tranche will have priority as to the &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche with respect to payments of principal, interest and any other amounts due thereunder.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(12)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (1M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(13)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (3M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(14)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to SOFR (1M) and SOFR (3M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(15)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to SOFR (3M) and SOFR (6M).</span></td></tr></table></ix:continuation><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:5pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(16)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"/></tr></table><div style="margin-top:2pt;"></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">158</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:93.09%;border:0;margin:30pt 3.45% 30pt 3.45%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:3.45%;padding-right:3.45%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:5.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">WHITEHORSE FINANCE,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Notes To Consolidated Financial Statements</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">December&#160;31, 2025</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;margin-left:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:continuation id="Group_Z7UkXD5hXEK7bIer2RpQLg_4" continuedAt="Group_Z7UkXD5hXEK7bIer2RpQLg_5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 18pt;">Below is a listing of STRS JV&#8217;s individual investments as of December&#160;31, 2024:</p></ix:continuation><a id="Tc_fHsUbzrNFU6IB8iGaN9jlw_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_dj1rEjJ-n0WjvMi4DyhvRg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_HWoGjUNzcUOucSlRd9SNrw_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_0HAPdojlFEee6