ion id="Group_Z7UkXD5hXEK7bIer2RpQLg_6"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(1)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Except as noted, all investments provide collateral for the STRS JV Credit Facility and are domiciled in the United States.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(2)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investments bear interest at a rate that may be determined by reference to SOFR, CORRA, SONIA, Prime, or EurIBOR. which resets monthly, quarterly or semiannually.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(3)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The interest rate is the &#8220;all-in-rate&#8221; including the current index and spread, the fixed rate, and the PIK interest rate, as the case may be.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(4)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Except as otherwise noted, all of the STRS JV&#8217;s portfolio company investments, which as of the date of the portfolio represented </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_Kmqho2OLs0mmjh1LnhlRVg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedPercentOfNetAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_cAls5QjBHE-iwa-ZKLbugQ">852.3</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> of STRS JV&#8217;s members&#8217; equity or </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_GgykcxQQtEeS_VFpzhiaZA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:PortfolioCompanyInvestmentsAsPercentageOfTotalAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_d0BijAFnQEKQRqLwxX6bxw">95.4</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> of STRS JV&#8217;s total assets, are subject to legal restrictions on sales.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(5)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The fair value of each investment was determined using significant unobservable inputs.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(6)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment or a portion of the investment does not provide collateral for the STRS JV Credit Facility.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(7)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The issuer is domiciled in Canada.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(8)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in GBP and the issuer is domiciled in the United Kingdom.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(9)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in Euros.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(10)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;"> Principal amount is denominated in CAD.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(11)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and a different base rate, SOFR, SONIA or CORRA. The Floor, Spread Above Index and Interest Rate presented represent the weighted average of both contracts.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(12)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The rate shown is the annualized seven-day yield as of December&#160;31,&#160;2024.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(13)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Investment is structured as a unitranche loan in which the STRS JV may receive additional interest on its &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche of the portfolio company&#8217;s senior term debt, which was previously syndicated into &#8220;first out&#8221; and &#8220;last out&#8221; tranches, whereby the &#8220;first out&#8221; tranche will have priority as to the &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche with respect to payments of principal, interest and any other amounts due thereunder.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:2pt;"></div></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 2pt 18pt;"><span style="margin-left:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;">As of December 31,&#160;2025, the portfolio companies underlying the Company&#8217;s investments are all located in the United States and its territories except for Cennox Holdings Limited, which is domiciled in the United Kingdom.&#160;As of December 31,&#160;2024, the portfolio companies underlying the Company&#8217;s investments are all located in the United States and its territories except for Geo Logic Systems Ltd., which is domiciled in Canada, and Cennox Holdings Limited which is domiciled in the United Kingdom.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">As of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31,&#160;2024, STRS JV had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_Kmqho2OLs0mmjh1LnhlRVg" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueNonAccrualStatus" scale="3" id="Narr_MRg_xmejiUiZksdS879gvg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_8JkZJmbCS0KmD2wvl0Fxsg" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueNonAccrualStatus" scale="3" id="Narr_BIjQElc3WkCH2CgrtRCpdg">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> investments on non-accrual status. STRS JV had outstanding commitments to fund investments totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_8JkZJmbCS0KmD2wvl0Fxsg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:OutstandingCommitmentsToFundInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_-bNScOYv8kKR46BbBmC7Tg">41,415</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_Kmqho2OLs0mmjh1LnhlRVg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:OutstandingCommitmentsToFundInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_vyyrx5hHYkGgVo2giEU7Lw">24,724</ix:nonFraction> under delayed draw term loan commitments and undrawn revolvers as of December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and December&#160;31, 2024, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">163</p></div></div>
