<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2026NotesMember_lXHvztUf7EC0RhIJ-_wMPQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_CLzSHnAstE2knkQ5VLbBkA">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% and are due on December&#160;4, 2026, unless redeemed, purchased or prepaid prior to such date by the Company or its affiliates in accordance with their terms. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2026NotesMember_lXHvztUf7EC0RhIJ-_wMPQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_kamJTRr_GEGd2eNW7K-TDQ">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2026 Notes is payable semiannually on June 4 and December 4, at a fixed, annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2026NotesMember_lXHvztUf7EC0RhIJ-_wMPQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_gVbq0EpLikapqnJaQ5IRvg">5.375</ix:nonFraction>%. This interest rate is subject to increase (up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2026NotesMember_htr8PY1WuUCQGhWEk2AjZg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_paGNYdCnmUOFu2-NatDlHg">6.375</ix:nonFraction>%) in the event that, subject to certain exceptions, the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_