<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">WHITEHORSE FINANCE,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Notes To Consolidated Financial Statements</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">December&#160;31, 2025</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_FeiIwMJ-1kO1Dppbnxb7BA_cont5" continuedAt="Tb_FeiIwMJ-1kO1Dppbnxb7BA_cont6"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">occur. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2026NotesMember_lXHvztUf7EC0RhIJ-_wMPQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr__Hvzcq46O0q3RJCf2uLUPw">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2026 Notes&#160;are general unsecured obligations of the Company that rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness issued by the Company. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_24_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPercent2026NotesMember_z0-_XkJMRUOqLkRFz96vGQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_lrqVc09ORUaQQFTPz8NZCA">4.000</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"> 2026 Notes</span>: On November&#160;24, 2021, the Company completed a public offering of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_11_24_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPercent2026NotesMember_z0-_XkJMRUOqLkRFz96vGQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_W_chbInYwE2hy5NHVlmDFQ">75,000</ix:nonFraction> of aggregate principal amount of unsecured notes, the net proceeds of which were used to fund investments in debt and equity securities and repay outstanding indebtedness under the Credit Facility. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_24_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPercent2026NotesMember_z0-_XkJMRUOqLkRFz96vGQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_dhhoOx_i_0-vXy9uTtE5nQ">4.000</ix:nonFraction>% 2026 Notes is payable semiannually on June 15 and December 15, at a fixed, annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_24_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPercent2026NotesMember_z0-_XkJMRUOqLkRFz96vGQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_huY_LkwuNkOvvdCgnGsqcQ">4.000</ix:nonFraction>%. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_24_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPercent2026NotesMember_z0-_XkJMRUOqLkRFz96vGQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_DuLDmaM7hk6rOb2CFcru4w">4.000</ix:nonFraction>% 2026 Notes&#160;will mature on December 15, 2026 and may be redeemed in whole or in part at any time prior to September 15, 2026, at par plus a &#8220;make-whole&#8221; premium, and thereafter at par. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_24_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPercent2026NotesMember_z0-_XkJMRUOqLkRFz96vGQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_2lCIazWeAkObSdPMeDglUw">4.000</ix:nonFraction>% 2026 Notes are direct unsecured obligations and are structurally subordinate to borrowings under the Credit Facility and will rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness.<span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"> </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_dcNeDWZ2o02PdxaODDXvFw">5.625</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"> 2027 Notes</span>: On December&#160;4, 2020, the Company entered into a Note Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;2027 Note Purchase Agreement&#8221;) governing the issuance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_xjInXUKARk6TUg6Ro2hQyw">10,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of unsecured notes (the &#8220;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_y-rcHyiKYUCY3BPe3ZaSQQ">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% 2027 Notes&#8221;) to qualified institutional investors in a private placement. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr__8Jiq3QN-Eqo8qA3_QPn_A">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% 2027 Notes&#160;have a fixed interest rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_4sXknkII0kqaLvKkl8lHtA">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% and are due on December&#160;4, 2027, unless redeemed, purchased or prepaid prior to such date by the Company or its affiliates in accordance with their terms. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_uR14Tax1k0WsN0c20oqikw">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% 2027 Notes is payable semiannually on June 4 and December 4, at a fixed, annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_x01aNuBsOUeg2cj8pUkDgA">5.625</ix:nonFraction>%. This interest rate is subject to increase (up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_50hVMS-fHU6VNogmRIJbyQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_X599awZsTEiiSMkOWnf6Ag">6.625</ix:nonFraction>%) in the event that, subject to certain exceptions, the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_F6TJqCBhV0SQqJ-1T6CthQ">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% 2027 Notes&#160;cease to have an investment grade rating. In addition, the Company is obligated to offer to repay the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_vKvVTcGs7UuUyI_1yp52Sw">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% 2027 Notes&#160;at par if certain change in control events occur. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_4_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointSixTwoFivePercent2027NotesMember_34MXcvQHhEqk-TPBQS4U2Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_dVont0GPjEezVmLA3zONFw">5.625</ix:nonFraction>% 2027 Notes&#160;are general unsecured obligations of the Company that rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness issued by the Company. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_YA-hjYmjpUyv6BGD9S7VEQ">4.250</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"> 2028 Notes</span>: On December 6, 2021, the Company entered into a Note Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;2028 Note Purchase Agreement,&#8221;) governing the issuance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_2RxWIzf4Skee0tWsZb8-UQ">25,000</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal amount of unsecured notes (the &#8220;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_FlcqdfTKRku0zHc6c1bF9w">4.25</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes&#8221;) to qualified institutional investors in a private placement. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_rS4RBVIyk0qeu8q3wRtR0g">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes&#160;is payable semiannually on June 6 and December 6, at a fixed, annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_0cfjBJRqXk2gjNuKT3eBKA">4.25</ix:nonFraction>%. This interest rate is subject to increase (up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember__PhZ5r79MUe47n68apTmpg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_oNam__yXOEyyFoR2Wl2xZg">5.25</ix:nonFraction>%) in the event that, subject to certain exceptions, the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_4EGqjy0SlU2hWoGUe5aTBw">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes cease to have an investment grade rating. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_QLnkvZxGukWuZ1nG54mHZw">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes&#160;mature on December 6, 2028, unless redeemed, purchased or prepaid prior to such date by us or our affiliates in accordance with their terms. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_cTBOn9s220mycWsUS2cV7A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ncfu3kOTjE6LVTBBm85dgg">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes are general unsecured obligations that rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness that we may issue. The closing of the transaction occurred on December 6, 2021. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_mxAWcR_ZUU-f5626UmQVPg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_2YRQksYSnEObhUzmi5R0Qg">7.875</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"> 2028 Notes</span>: On August 24, 2023, the Company completed a public offering of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_mxAWcR_ZUU-f5626UmQVPg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_GX8M3aS490GCJmdcd6l3mQ">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes in aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_mxAWcR_ZUU-f5626UmQVPg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_VORItyWJqkWN4X_lvZPcpg">30,000</ix:nonFraction>, the net proceeds of which were used to fund investments in debt and equity securities and repay outstanding indebtedness under its revolving credit facility. Additionally, the offering included an overallotment feature for up to an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_LGPph_vseEyKkyAzPMfdpQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_KZkgBi7g4E6twa-Ku_eYMA">4,500</ix:nonFraction> of aggregate principal amount under the same terms as the initial offering. On August 31, 2023, the underwriters fully exercised their option to purchase an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="Duration_8_31_2023_To_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_ZdSojvd3ikaWqHs3aDZ9IA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_6oeP7HysE0KfYr3DKcRn3A">4,500</ix:nonFraction>, bringing the aggregate principal amount of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_6dhCtsgC_02VZ50xOP_NMg">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_FFkwHGwPOkyNVvvR70yQzA" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_HSmmmtCNp0Cesnz73jD2Og">34,500</ix:nonFraction>. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_mECjg4KOTUCxeV3oDRobGg">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes is paid quarterly on March 15, June 15, September 15 and December 15 each year, at an annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_-cWRVIexgk-oj8e32zHZJw">7.875</ix:nonFraction>%. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_K8NFKGFuJ0KKinsv1eMFuA">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes will mature on September 15, 2028 and may be redeemed in whole or in part at any time, or from time to time, at the Company&#8217;s option on or after September 15, 2025. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Hft0zwiVaUSAIOv1lzqhgw">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes are direct unsecured obligations and are structurally subordinate to borrowings under the Credit Facility and will rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness we may issue. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_OB6QXf9I0kejVMhTvRVYrQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_QHLSJBSZeUKWCkbCTVgECQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_sX13n2c2-0SBsVdfwGaKhg">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes are listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the trading symbol &#8220;WHFCL.&#8221; </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">174</p></div></div>
