 Amendment No. 1 to the Registration Statement on Form N-2, filed on September&#160;25, 2012)</span></a></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.05%;margin:0pt;padding:2.65pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;white-space:pre-wrap;">&#8199;4.2</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:88.94%;margin:0pt;padding:2.65pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a style="-sec-extract:exhibit;font-family:&quot;'Times New Roman','Times','serif'&quot;;" href="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1552198/000114420418059444/tv507077_ex99d5.htm"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Indenture, dated as of November&#160;13, 2018, by and between WhiteHorse Finance, Inc. and American Stock Transfer &amp; Trust Company, LLC, as trustee (incorporated herein by reference to Exhibit (d)&#160;(5)&#160;of Post-Effective Amendment No. 5 to Registration Statement on Form N-2 (File No. 333-217093), filed on November&#160;13, 2018)</span></a></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.05%;margin:0pt;padding:2.65pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;white-space:pre-wrap;">&#8199;4.3</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:88.94%;margin:0pt;padding:2.65pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a style="-sec-extract:exhibit;font-family:&quot;'Times New Roman','Times','serif'&quot;;" href="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1552198/000114420418059444/tv507077_ex99d6.htm"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">First